---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Your China Trip Survival Kit: Everything You Need Before You Go";
const description = "From apps and SIM cards to VPN and packing — here's your complete pre-travel checklist for China.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Life
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🎒 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Your China Trip Survival Kit<br class="hidden md:block" />: Everything You Need Before You Go
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">旅行前要解决的五件事——没有一件是困难的，但每一件都很重要。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>在中国旅行之前，你需要整理五件事：你的手机、你的互联网连接、你的VPN、一些基本的中文短语和你的行李。</strong> None of them are difficult, but each one can make or break your pleasant trip if overlooked. Here's a quick guide to figure out what you actually need — then dive into the detailed articles for each topic.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#phone-apps" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📱 你的手机：你有合适的应用程序吗？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#connection" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📶 您的连接：eSIM、SIM卡还是漫游？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#vpn" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔒 您的VPN：在中国自由访问互联网</a></li>
        <li><a href="#language" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🗣️ 你的语言能力：你需要多少中文？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#luggage" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎒 你的行李：在中国旅行有什么不同？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#checklist" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">✅ 最终出发前检查表</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="phone-apps" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📱</span> Your Phone: Do You Have the Right Apps?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">Here's the thing about China: <strong>你每天在家使用的应用程序可能在这里不起作用。</strong> Google Maps shows wrong directions. WhatsApp doesn't send messages. Uber doesn't exist. And you can't pay with your foreign credit card at most places.</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">在你到达之前，你需要下载一套新的应用程序——微信和支付宝用于支付，滴滴用于乘车，Amap用于导航，还有其他一些应用程序。</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">不确定你真正需要哪些？完整的指南按类别分类，并告诉你每个应用程序的功能。</p>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>📖 完整指南：</strong> <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">前往中国前需要的10个应用程序</a></p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="connection" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📶</span> Your Connection: eSIM, SIM Card, or Roaming?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">你一着陆就需要互联网接入——用于地图、翻译、叫车和消息传递。问题是哪种选择适合你的手机和你的行程长度。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">在中国上网的三种方式：</p>

      <ul class="space-y-4 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <span class="text-blue-500 text-xl mt-0.5">📱</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-gray-900">在线（airalo、Holafly）——着陆时激活</strong>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">出发前在线购买，着陆时激活，无需实体卡。如果你的手机支持它，并且你想要零麻烦，那就最好了。这种类型的卡通常只提供数据流量，并允许使用WhatsApp和YouTube等海外应用程序。然而，它不提供中国手机号码。如果您计划使用滴滴或订购外卖和其他需要接听电话的服务，建议您购买实体SIM卡。</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <span class="text-green-500 text-xl mt-0.5">🆔</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-gray-900">旅游SIM卡</strong>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">Buy at the airport counter after you land. Requires your passport. Gives you a Chinese phone number. However, due to domestic network restrictions, many foreign apps won't work — you'll want to set up a VPN <strong>之前</strong> departure.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <span class="text-purple-500 text-xl mt-0.5">🌍</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-gray-900">国际漫游</strong>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">最昂贵，但零设置。请先与您的运营商确认。</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>📖 完整指南：</strong> <a href="/zh/life/sim-card-guide/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">中国游客最佳SIM卡和eSIM</a></p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="vpn" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔒</span> Your VPN: Accessing the Internet Freely in China
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">Here's a reality check: <strong>谷歌、Instagram、WhatsApp、脸书、YouTube——这些都不适用于中国国内互联网。</strong> If you rely on any of them for communication, work, or entertainment, you need a VPN set up before you arrive.</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">The keyword is <strong>之前</strong> — VPN websites and apps are blocked inside China, so you can't download one after you land.</p>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>📖 完整指南：</strong> <a href="/zh/life/vpn-guide/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">在中国旅行的最佳VPN</a></p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="language" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🗣️</span> Your Language Skills: How Much Chinese Do You Need?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">你绝对可以不说中文就去中国旅行。但如果你学会了十几个短语，你会过得更好——更好的服务、更好的价格、更好的互动。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">诚实的崩溃：</p>

      <ul class="space-y-4 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-orange-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-orange-500 text-xl">😅</span>
          <div>
            <strong>零中文：</strong> You'll survive. English is common in hotels and tourist spots, but expect frustration at restaurants and local shops.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-green-500 text-xl">👍</span>
          <div>
            <strong>10-15个短语：</strong> You'll be fine. Being able to say "thank you," "how much," and "check please" changes how people treat you.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-blue-500 text-xl">🚀</span>
          <div>
            <strong>50+个短语：</strong> You're ahead of most travelers and will navigate independently.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>📖 完整指南：</strong> <a href="/zh/life/chinese-phrases/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">旅行者必备的汉语短语</a></p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="luggage" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎒</span> Your Luggage: What's Different About Traveling in China?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">中国的打包与其他任何旅行都没有太大不同，但有几件事让第一次来中国的人措手不及：</p>

      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🚻</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700">公共厕所通常没有卫生纸（自带）</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🗺️</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700">谷歌地图在中国无法使用（下载本地地图）</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🌡️</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700">南北气候差异很大</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">👟</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700">你会走得比你想象的多得多</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>📖 完整指南：</strong> <a href="/zh/life/packing-guide/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">为中国打包什么——季节与气候指南</a></p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="checklist" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> The Ultimate Pre-Departure Checklist
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">完成？</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">任务</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">帮助</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">下载微信和支付宝，设置支付</td><td class="px-6 py-4">支付一切</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">安装滴滴、Amap、Trip.com</td><td class="px-6 py-4">四处走走</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">购买eSIM或查看漫游计划</td><td class="px-6 py-4">保持联系</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4"><a href="/zh/life/vpn-guide/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">设置VPN</a></td><td class="px-6 py-4">访问被屏蔽的网站</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">下载谷歌翻译离线包或Pleco</td><td class="px-6 py-4">沟通</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">学习10个基本的中文短语</td><td class="px-6 py-4">日常互动</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">打包电源、纸巾、适配器</td><td class="px-6 py-4">避免常见问题</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">☐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">保存护照+签证的数字副本</td><td class="px-6 py-4">应急备份</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 前往中国前需要的10个应用程序</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">中国旅游必备应用工具包</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/sim-card-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📶 游客最佳SIM卡和eSIM</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">比较所有连接选项</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/vpn-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🔒 在中国旅行的最佳VPN</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">保持与所需应用程序的连接</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/packing-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 为中国打包什么</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">按季节打包建议</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>编译指南——本网站上每篇文章的来源。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>